- Read exactly one value from each: `return <-a + <-b` (sequential, fine).
- Honour cancellation: add `case <-ctx.Done(): return total, ctx.Err()`.
- N channels: fan-in with one goroutine per channel into a merged channel plus a WaitGroup that closes it, or `reflect.Select`.

